1vel para TODO usu\u00e1rio j\u00e1 logado. Fix: o jwt callback rel\u00ea o banco quando o claim est\u00e1 AUSENTE (=== undefined, \u2260 null); null expl\u00edcito (usu\u00e1rio novo) n\u00e3o rel\u00ea. O wizard tamb\u00e9m virou dispens\u00e1vel (nudge, n\u00e3o trava) e o finish() fecha no POST, com updateSession best-effort."}, {"id": "_context_features_onboarding_labels_only", "label": "S\u00f3 R\u00d3TULOS de UI mudam (n\u00e3o renomear c\u00f3digo/rotas/modelos)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/onboarding.md", "source_location": "Decis\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O modelo Prisma Patient, /api/patients e a rota /pacientes mant\u00eam o nome t\u00e9cnico."}, {"id": "_context_features_onboarding_segmento_label", "label": "R\u00f3tulo \"Ramo\" \u2192 \"Segmento\" na UI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/onboarding.md", "source_location": "R\u00f3tulo Ramo \u2192 Segmento", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "S\u00f3 o TEXTO vis\u00edvel mudou (label, t\u00edtulo do wizard, erro 'Segmento inv\u00e1lido'); o campo/enum continua businessType e os coment\u00e1rios que dizem 'ramo' ficaram."}], "edges": [{"source": "_context_features_onboarding_feature", "target": "_context_features_onboarding_businesstype", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/onboarding.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_onboarding_feature", "target": "_context_features_onboarding_terminology", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/onboarding.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_onboarding_feature", "target": "_context_features_onboarding_jwt_stale_fix", "relation": "references", "confidence":